OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CHormuz swim highlights environmental   
OL,5,Ccost of war                            
OL,6,GA British endurance swimmer has        
OL,7,Gcompleted a three-day swim through the 
OL,8,GStrait of Hormuz to draw attention to  
OL,9,Gwhat he says is the environmental cost 
OL,10,Gof the conflict involving Iran.        
OL,12,FLewis Pugh, who is a UN Patron of the  
OL,13,FOceans, swam about 15km (9.3 miles)    
OL,14,Fthrough the strategic waterway, a key  
OL,15,Froute for oil shipments from the       
OL,16,FMiddle East.                           
OL,18,FPugh, 56, who was born in Plymouth,    
OL,19,FDevon said "war causes immense human   
OL,20,Fsuffering" but nature is "another      
OL,21,Fcasualty that receives far too little  
OL,22,Fattention".                       G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
