OL,4,CCrane set to lift collapsed bridge out 
OL,5,Cof harbour                             
OL,6,GWork to repair a bridge which          
OL,7,Gcollapsed into a city's harbour is set 
OL,8,Gto begin.                              
OL,10,FPero's Bridge in Bristol, which could  
OL,11,Flift to allow boats under it, was left 
OL,12,Fpartially hanging due to a mechanical  
OL,13,Ffailure in the summer. It then toppled 
OL,14,Fagain, collapsing into the water on 31 
OL,15,FOctober.                               
OL,17,FEarlier this month, a Bristol City     
OL,18,FCouncil report found the bridge was    
OL,19,Funable to be properly tested for       
OL,20,Falmost a decade before its collapse    
OL,21,Fdue to the weight of padlocks attached 
OL,22,Fto it.                            G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
