OL,4,CMet Office issues weather warning for  
OL,5,Crain                                   
OL,6,GThe Met Office has warned that heavy   
OL,7,Grain could cause disruption in parts   
OL,8,Gof Devon and Cornwall, with flooding   
OL,9,Gand travel delays possible.            
OL,11,FA band of rain is set to move across   
OL,12,Fthe two counties through Sunday, with  
OL,13,Fmore than 100mm (3in) of rain possible 
OL,14,Fover Dartmoor.                         
OL,16,FChief Met Office forecaster Matthew    
OL,17,FLehnert said: "This slow-moving band   
OL,18,Fof rain will gradually ease on Sunday  
OL,19,Fnight, but flooding and travel         
OL,20,Fdisruption is possible within the      
OL,21,Fwarning area."                         
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
